{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19185","headline":"酬令狐相公寄贺迁拜之什 · 刘禹锡","name":"酬令狐相公寄贺迁拜之什","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"邅廻二纪重爲郎，洛下遥分列宿光。\n不见当关呼早起，曾无侍史与焚香。\n三花秀色通春幌，十字清波遶宅墙。\n白发青衫谁比数，相怜只是有梁王。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19185.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19185","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}